# Dynamic audio buffering: a source whose audio_ts lags the tick start by 30 ms makes the mixer add 2 ticks of buffering.
# While buffering_wait_ticks > 0 nothing is mixed and audio_callback returns false (ret=0).
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
timeline 1000000000
source a input
video_mix 1
channel 0 0 a
set a active 1
output a 48000 2 1024 970000000 const 0.25
output a 48000 2 1024 991333333 const 0.25
output a 48000 2 1024 1012666666 const 0.25
output a 48000 2 1024 1034000000 const 0.25
output a 48000 2 1024 1055333333 const 0.25
output a 48000 2 1024 1076666666 const 0.25
state a
run 6 1
state a
